WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.717
You add charge items to a patient's account from charge item definitions. Step 1.

1.2
00:00:05.717 --> 00:00:10.469
In Billing, open the account, then select the Charge Items tab.

2.1
00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:17.432
Step 2. Select Add Charge Items. The form lists only Active definitions.

3.1
00:00:17.432 --> 00:00:23.209
Step 3. In the Select charge item definition picker, select a definition.

3.2
00:00:23.209 --> 00:00:26.465
Care adds it as a row under Selected items.

3.3
00:00:26.465 --> 00:00:30.220
To add more items, select more definitions.

4.1
00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:34.541
Step 4. In each row, enter the Quantity as a whole number.

4.2
00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:39.743
You can select the Performer, the person who performed the service.

5.1
00:00:39.743 --> 00:00:46.949
Step 5. Select Add Items. Care adds one Billable charge item for each row.
